%% description: The life of one comment thread between the person and the agent.
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state Draft
    state Sent
    state Read
    state Answered
    state Resolved
    state "Removed from the File" as Removed
    [*] --> Draft : person writes
    Draft --> Sent : person sends
    Sent --> Read : agent get_comments
    Read --> Answered : agent reply_comment
    Read --> Resolved : agent resolve_comment
    Answered --> Resolved : agent resolve_comment
    Sent --> Draft : person edits
    Read --> Draft : person edits or replies
    Answered --> Draft : person replies
    Resolved --> Draft : person replies
    Resolved --> Removed : person dismisses
    Draft --> Removed : person deletes
    Removed --> [*]
    note right of Draft : only the person sees a draft
